{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8de4c54e-4fbe-4938-8f38-078521480456",
    "name": "YZY Contracts — Doc Extractor API (Automated Tests)",
    "description": "Colección oficial con **pruebas automatizadas (`pm.test`)** para `doc-extractor-api` (FastAPI + Docling).\n\nIncluye:\n1. **Health & Readiness**: validación de liveness, motor Docling (`converter_ready`), clave configurada (`api_key_configured`) y lista blanca de R2 (`r2_hosts_configured`).\n2. **Seguridad, SSRF & Validaciones (100% deterministas)**: pruebas de `401 UNAUTHORIZED`, protección anti-SSRF (`400 FORBIDDEN_DOWNLOAD_URL` por host no autorizado y por esquema HTTP) y `422 INVALID_REQUEST`.\n3. **Extracción Documental (R2 Presigned URLs)**: pruebas de contrato sobre `ExtractionResponse` (`200 OK`) y manejo de errores de almacenamiento (`403 STORAGE_ACCESS_DENIED` / `410 PRESIGNED_URL_EXPIRED` / `502 DOWNLOAD_FAILED`).\n\nConfigura base_url para el entorno que vas a probar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Header X-Request-Id está presente en toda respuesta', function () {",
          "    pm.response.to.have.header('X-Request-Id');",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id')).to.be.a('string').and.not.be.empty;",
          "});",
          "",
          "pm.test('Content-Type de respuesta es application/json', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Health & Readiness",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health — Liveness Check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code es 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Contrato de liveness válido', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.service).to.eql('doc-extractor-api');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.version).to.be.a('string').and.not.be.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Tiempo de respuesta menor a 500ms', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que el proceso FastAPI esté vivo y responda dentro del SLA."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /ready — Readiness + Docling Engine Check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code es 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Todos los subsistemas están listos (API key, R2 allowlist y Docling converter)', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ready');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.service).to.eql('doc-extractor-api');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.checks).to.be.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.checks.api_key_configured).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.checks.r2_hosts_configured).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.checks.converter_ready).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/ready",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["ready"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que el motor Docling esté inicializado y los hosts R2 estén configurados."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Seguridad, SSRF & Validaciones (Automated Suite)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /internal/v1/extract — Sin X-Internal-API-Key (401 UNAUTHORIZED)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rechaza petición sin header X-Internal-API-Key con 401', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve ErrorResponse estándar con código UNAUTHORIZED', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('error');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error.code).to.eql('UNAUTHORIZED');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error.message).to.be.a('string').and.not.be.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"job_id\": \"ae17c335-55bc-401a-a46a-391dc7b54d8b\",\n  \"document\": {\n    \"filename\": \"contrato_servicios.pdf\",\n    \"content_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n    \"download_url\": \"https://{{r2_host}}/yzy-contracts/contrato.pdf\"\n  }\n}"
